      <h2>The vibe</h2>
      <p>L'Eden Canin has no fixed shopfront: it's a mobile grooming salon set up inside a fitted-out motorhome, run by Jessica, who comes directly to you within a 20 km radius of Villeneuve-Loubet. A practical option if you're renting on the French Riviera and don't want to hunt for an address with your dog.</p>

      <h2>What to know before you go</h2>
      <p>The service runs by appointment, Monday to Saturday from 9am to 6pm — these hours are confirmed identically across several independent professional directories (PagesJaunes, Aladom, Justacote, Mappy), as is the fitted-out motorhome concept and the 20 km service radius, which gives a good confidence level on this information. Massage is among the treatments offered, alongside classic grooming.</p>
      <div class="callout">Coco's tip: handy during a rental holiday on the French Riviera — no need to find an address, the groomer comes straight to you with all the equipment.</div>

      <h2>Nearby</h2>
      <p>Since the service covers a whole 20 km radius around Villeneuve-Loubet, it can also operate around Cagnes-sur-Mer or Biot depending on where you're staying — worth checking when booking. Locally, the <a href="/en/fiche-villeneuve-loubet">Villeneuve-Loubet beach</a> and another <a href="/en/fiche-toiletteur-patoun-villeneuve-loubet">groomer in the same area</a> round out the useful addresses, as does <a href="/en/fiche-camping-green-park-cagnes-sur-mer">Camping Green Park</a> in Cagnes-sur-Mer if you're staying there.</p>
